# Crabomination: a zone with nothing in it contributes nothing. Bot2's whole deck is eight Ornithopters: its turn-2 draw
# takes the last card of the library, and it casts all eight, so on turn 3 its library, graveyard and hand are all empty.
# Crabomination's enters ability targets Bot2 and exiles nothing (and asks nothing: ! Bot1.Choose).
# Crabomination is cast on turn 3 for {4}{B}{B}: Black Lotus's mana, a Mox Jet and two Swamps.

